        ["home.what.p2"] = ("I did not trust the import until I could check it, so every glass is evaluated at the exact d, F and C lines and compared with the n<sub>d</sub> and ν<sub>d</sub> its maker prints — numbers that do not depend on the fit — on every commit. N-BK7 I pinned further, to its SCHOTT datasheet for internal transmittance and dn/dT. Nothing on this site is typed in: the pages run the packages and show what comes out.",
