        ["play.slab.text"] = ("D65 daylight enters the slab at {0}°, loses {1}% at the first face, travels {2} mm inside, and loses the same fraction again at the exit face. Bulk absorption comes from the manufacturer's k(λ) table, surface loss from the exact Fresnel equations at each wavelength, and the colour from integrating what is left against the CIE 1931 2° observer.",
